;
; How Isobar files one observation in MYRA (isobar_rules.h IR4): under
; its station, when it was read (seconds since 1970) and its kind (1 air
; temperature in tenths of a degree Celsius, 2 pressure in tenths of a
; hPa, 3 humidity in tenths of a percent, 4 wind in tenths of a metre a
; second, 5 rain in tenths of a millimetre), the reading and its state
; (0 accepted, 1 refused and kept for the owner to see). The model asks
; whether the numbers fit before it keeps the observation.
^ZXISOBAR(station:i4, stamp:i11, kind:i1) = reading:i7! ^ state:i1!
